   "announcedAt": "2025-06-26T12:51:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "ːsteamhappyː Alright, this is it people! ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The best game update I've ever created!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I've been working tirelessly on the game, fixing loads of small bugs, adding stability fixes and improving the gameplay and now it's finally time for you to experience it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch 3 (v1.07) notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added a FOV Slider!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added roll on fall, Val will now auto roll from medium heights!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved texture quality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Gameplay bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Quest bugfixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Getting rid of pesky memory leaks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Controller improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various quality of life improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lots of smaller QoL improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm very happy with patch 3, and as someone who has just played the game for the 1.435.837th time, this was the most fun playthrough yet! ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy playing!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
