   "announcedAt": "2025-04-15T17:15:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "ːsteamhappyː Time for Patch 2 ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In Patch 2 I've focussed mainly on improving quality & stability!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "By updating you can expect",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Improved visual fidelity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved texture quality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved voice acting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed various small bugs in quests",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various quality of life improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Overal performance improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Anti-Aliasing & Upscaling options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Update to Nvidia DLSS 4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Intel XeSS 2 Upscaling",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Qualcomm Snapdragon GSR 2 Upscaling",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "World premiere of the new Arm ASR Upscaling for Unity!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As you can see, I've gone haywire with adding upscaling options! When adding the graphical option to select your own prefered upscaler I thought, why not add them all. And if you don't like to use upscalers, you're now able to disable them all together ːsteamhappyː",
