  {
   "id": "city-of-springs-217219@1",
   "gameId": "city-of-springs-217219",
   "displayName": "Patch 1",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-20T10:25:37.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "ːsteamhappyː It's official, the first patch, version 1.05, one of many to come, has been uploaded to Steam! ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This patch has been focused on performance, performance, performance! So, after updating you can expect:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Engine update to Unity 6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Many small quality of life improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Performance improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More stable framerates (less frame hitching)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved shadow quality",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved draw distance",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved loading speeds",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved texture streaming",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Decreased memory usage",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated to FSR 3.1",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updated to DLSS 3.10",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Needless to say, in the past month and a half I’ve only worked on improving the game’s performance, but now I’ve arrived at the edge of the capabilities of the current, so called “renderpipeline”. A few years ago, Unity introduced a new renderpipeline called the “Universal Renderpipeline”, and I in all my wisdom decided NOT to use it back then, because as all things new & Unity it was very buggy.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "But nowadays it’s much better than the legacy version, and so it’s time to upgrade! If you’re interested in following this process, I will be livestreaming the first few hours of absolutely destroying City of Springs, because as Val would say: “You have to first break things to upgrade them… and when things are broken, you fix it!”.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So join up, tomorrow, Friday the 21st at 16:00 CET, to watch the city of Rivetton be utterly destroyed and get all PINK, and hopefully get build back up again",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can it watch here: https://www.youtube.com/@The-Naked-Dev/streams",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hope to see you tomorrow!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dominic",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Naked Dev",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
